Error [jet.AliasWithoutParameters]: `limit: Int` declares a type alias, so `limit` isn't a number
  --> tests/ui/type_alias_used_as_number.jet:3:1
    |
  3 | limit: Int
    | ^^^^^
 Why: At file level `name: Type` with no value names a type; a number constant writes its value after the type
 Fix: Give it a value: `LIMIT: Int{0}`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0324
